   "name": "Switcheroo!",
   "tooltip": "Jinx swaps weapons between Fishbones the rocket launcher and Pow-Pow the minigun.<br><br>While using the rocket launcher, Jinx's Attacks deal <physicalDamage>@RocketDamage@ physical damage</physicalDamage> to the target and nearby enemies, gain @RocketBonusRange@ range, cost Mana, and scale @RocketASPDPenalty*100@% less with bonus Attack Speed.<br><br>While using the minigun, Jinx's Attacks grant <attackSpeed>Attack Speed</attackSpeed> for @MinigunAttackSpeedDuration@ seconds, stacking up to @MinigunAttackSpeedStacks@ times (<attackSpeed>+@MinigunAttackSpeedMax@% %i:scaleAS% max</attackSpeed>).",
